{"seq":2,"slug":"inference-optimization","title":"推理优化与加速","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/inference-optimization","wordCount":1217,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理优化与加速\">推理优化与加速</h1><p>在生产环境中，模型推理的成本和延迟往往决定了一个 ML 项目的商业可行性。一个在 V100 上需要 200ms 才能完成推理的模型，如果通过优化降到 20ms，意味着同一块 GPU 的吞吐量提升 10 倍——这直接转化为 10 倍的成本节省。推理优化是 MLOps 平台工程师的核心技能之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>推理优化的目标是在<strong>精度损失可接受的前提下</strong>，最小化单次推理延迟和最大化单 GPU 吞吐量。优化发生在多个层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[模型层优化] --&gt; B[量化]&#10;    A --&gt; C[剪枝]&#10;    A --&gt; D[蒸馏]&#10;    E[编译层优化] --&gt; F[图优化]&#10;    E --&gt; G[算子融合]&#10;    E --&gt; H[TensorRT / ONNX Runtime]&#10;    I[服务层优化] --&gt; J[动态批处理]&#10;    I --&gt; K[并发管理]&#10;    I --&gt; L[资源池化]&#10;    M[系统层优化] --&gt; N[内存管理]&#10;    M --&gt; O[IO 优化]&#10;    M --&gt; P[硬件亲和]\">graph TD\n    A[模型层优化] --&gt; B[量化]\n    A --&gt; C[剪枝]\n    A --&gt; D[蒸馏]\n    E[编译层优化] --&gt; F[图优化]\n    E --&gt; G[算子融合]\n    E --&gt; H[TensorRT / ONNX Runtime]\n    I[服务层优化] --&gt; J[动态批处理]\n    I --&gt; K[并发管理]\n    I --&gt; L[资源池化]\n    M[系统层优化] --&gt; N[内存管理]\n    M --&gt; O[IO 优化]\n    M --&gt; P[硬件亲和]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化层次</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>精度影响</th>\n<th>加速倍数</th>\n<th>适用模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型层</td>\n<td>INT8 量化</td>\n<td>&lt; 1% 损失</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>CNN/Transformer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型层</td>\n<td>INT4 量化</td>\n<td>1-3% 损失</td>\n<td>3-6x</td>\n<td>LLM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型层</td>\n<td>结构化剪枝</td>\n<td>0-2% 损失</td>\n<td>1.5-3x</td>\n<td>大型模型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译层</td>\n<td>TensorRT</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>2-5x</td>\n<td>NVIDIA GPU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译层</td>\n<td>算子融合</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>1.3-2x</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务层</td>\n<td>动态批处理</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>2-8x</td>\n<td>高并发场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务层</td>\n<td>连续批处理</td>\n<td>无损</td>\n<td>3-10x</td>\n<td>LLM</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"量化技术\">量化技术</h2><p>量化是将模型权重和激活从高精度（FP32）转换为低精度（INT8/INT4/FP16）的过程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{quantized} = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{W_{float}}{s}\\right), \\quad s = \\frac{\\max(|W|)}{2^{n-1} - 1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 是缩放因子，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是目标位宽。</p>\n<p><strong>三种量化策略：</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>训练后量化（PTQ）</strong>：模型训练完成后直接量化，无需重训练。适合对精度要求不苛刻的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>量化感知训练（QAT）</strong>：在训练过程中模拟量化噪声，模型学会在低精度下保持性能。精度最高但需要重训练。</li>\n<li><strong>GPTQ/AWQ（LLM 专用）</strong>：利用激活值的统计分布进行逐层最优量化。2026 年 LLM 部署的标准方案。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 使用 ONNX Runtime 做 INT8 动态量化&#10;import onnxruntime as ort&#10;from onnxruntime.quantization import quantize_dynamic, QuantType&#10;&#10;quantize_dynamic(&#10;    model_input=&quot;model.onnx&quot;,&#10;    model_output=&quot;model_int8.onnx&quot;,&#10;    weight_type=QuantType.QInt8,&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用 ONNX Runtime 做 INT8 动态量化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onnxruntime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onnxruntime.quantization </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> quantize_dynamic, QuantType</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">quantize_dynamic(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model.onnx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    model_output</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"model_int8.onnx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    weight_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">QuantType.QInt8,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"编译优化\">编译优化</h2><p>模型编译器将高层次的计算图转换为针对特定硬件优化的低层次代码：</p>\n<p><strong>TensorRT（NVIDIA GPU 专用）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>层融合：将 Conv + BN + ReLU 合并为单一 kernel</li>\n<li>精度校准：自动选择每层的最优精度（FP32/FP16/INT8 混合）</li>\n<li>动态形状：支持可变输入尺寸</li>\n<li>加速效果：通常 2-5 倍于原生 PyTorch</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>ONNX Runtime：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>跨平台：CPU/GPU/NPU 统一推理接口</li>\n<li>图优化：常量折叠、冗余节点消除、形状推断</li>\n<li>执行提供者：CUDA/TensorRT/DirectML/OpenVINO 可切换</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>torch.compile（PyTorch 2.x+）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>JIT 编译：将 Python 代码编译为优化的内核</li>\n<li>无需导出：在原有 PyTorch 代码上一行调用</li>\n<li>后端可选：Inductor（默认）/ TensorRT / ONNX Runtime</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"动态批处理\">动态批处理</h2><p>动态批处理是服务层最有效的优化——将短时间窗口内到达的多个请求聚合为一个 batch 在 GPU 上执行：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>调优方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>max_batch_size</td>\n<td>最大聚合请求数</td>\n<td>GPU 显存允许的上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>max_wait_time</td>\n<td>最长等待时间</td>\n<td>延迟 SLA 允许的上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>preferred_batch_size</td>\n<td>偏好的 batch 大小</td>\n<td>GPU 利用率最优点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>throughput</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>batch_size</mtext><mtext>latency_per_batch</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{throughput} = \\frac{\\text{batch\\_size}}{\\text{latency\\_per\\_batch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">throughput</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">latency_per_batch</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">batch_size</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>动态批处理的关键权衡：更大的 batch size 提升吞吐但增加平均延迟（请求需要等待凑批）。实践中通常设置 max_wait_time 为 SLA 的 10-20%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"llm-推理优化-paged-attention-与连续批处理\">LLM 推理优化：Paged Attention 与连续批处理</h2><p>LLM 推理有独特的优化维度——KV Cache 管理是核心瓶颈：</p>\n<p><strong>Paged Attention（vLLM 核心创新）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>问题：传统 KV Cache 需要连续内存分配，长序列导致内存碎片和浪费</li>\n<li>方案：像操作系统的虚拟内存一样，将 KV Cache 分页管理</li>\n<li>效果：内存利用率从约 50% 提升到 95%+，吞吐量提升 2-4 倍</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>连续批处理（Continuous Batching）：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>问题：传统批处理要等所有请求完成才能释放 GPU——短请求被长请求拖住</li>\n<li>方案：每个 iteration 可以插入新请求和移出已完成请求</li>\n<li>效果：GPU 利用率显著提升，尾延迟大幅降低</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 传统批处理&#10;        A1[请求1 ████████] --&gt; X1[全部完成]&#10;        A2[请求2 ████] --&gt; X1&#10;        A3[请求3 ██████] --&gt; X1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 连续批处理&#10;        B1[请求1 ████████]&#10;        B2[请求2 ████ → 插入请求4]&#10;        B3[请求3 ██████ → 插入请求5]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 传统批处理\n        A1[请求1 ████████] --&gt; X1[全部完成]\n        A2[请求2 ████] --&gt; X1\n        A3[请求3 ██████] --&gt; X1\n    end\n    subgraph 连续批处理\n        B1[请求1 ████████]\n        B2[请求2 ████ → 插入请求4]\n        B3[请求3 ██████ → 插入请求5]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"gpu-资源池化\">GPU 资源池化</h2><p>在多模型共存的平台环境中，GPU 资源池化是成本优化的关键：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>NVIDIA MIG（Multi-Instance GPU）</strong>：将 A100/H100 物理分割为多个独立实例</li>\n<li><strong>时间分片（Time-slicing）</strong>：多个模型轮流使用同一 GPU</li>\n<li><strong>虚拟 GPU（vGPU）</strong>：通过虚拟化层分配 GPU 资源</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>隔离性</th>\n<th>性能损失</th>\n<th>灵活性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>MIG</td>\n<td>硬件级</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>固定分割</td>\n<td>稳定工作负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Time-slicing</td>\n<td>无隔离</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>开发/测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>vGPU</td>\n<td>驱动级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>多租户平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>推理优化分四层：模型层/编译层/服务层/系统层</li>\n<li>量化是最通用的优化手段（INT8 几乎无损，2-4 倍加速）</li>\n<li>动态批处理是服务层最有效的优化</li>\n<li>LLM 推理的核心优化是 Paged Attention + 连续批处理</li>\n<li>GPU 资源池化是平台级成本优化的必备能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../mlops-model-deployment/serving/scaling-inference\">MLOps 模型部署：扩展推理</a> — 推理扩展的基础策略</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../ai-llm/ai-infrastructure-mlops/model-optimization/quantization-deep-dive\">AI 基础设施：量化深入</a> — 量化技术的底层原理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推理优化与加速","id":"推理优化与加速"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"量化技术","id":"量化技术"},{"level":2,"text":"编译优化","id":"编译优化"},{"level":2,"text":"动态批处理","id":"动态批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"LLM 推理优化：Paged Attention 与连续批处理","id":"llm-推理优化-paged-attention-与连续批处理"},{"level":2,"text":"GPU 资源池化","id":"gpu-资源池化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"模型服务架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/model-serving-patterns"},"next":{"title":"金丝雀与 A/B 部署策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/mlops-platform/serving/canary-ab-deployment"}}